      "title": "End-market demand",
      "category": "end_markets",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "title": "AI and agent-related demand",
          "text": "Management characterized the shift toward AI answer engines and agent-driven commerce as changing Internet traffic and said Cloudflare was seeing a fundamental rewrite toward machine-to-machine traffic.",
